# Sooty Earth pipelines

Read `docs/sooty-earth-roadmap.md` in `marynvdl/naturewatch-app` before pipeline work. When the clones are siblings, that file is `../naturewatch-app/docs/sooty-earth-roadmap.md`.

Do not open or merge a pull request from `develop` into `main` in the app repo until a production release is explicitly requested.

The crop, built, and bare virtual-machine tasks are retired. Their folders are in `archive/vm-tile-tasks/`, and their workflows do not start a machine. `tasks/fireTiles/` is the live fire task and does not start one. Do not push a commit that restores the old virtual-machine workflows: GitHub runs the workflow in the commit you push. New pipeline code lives outside `tasks/` until a workflow is added on purpose and started by hand.

One roadmap step per branch and chat. Do not start the next step until the current step's done-when is met.
